<div class="hero-section">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="hero-badge"><span class="dot"></span> Built for Québec French, not textbook French</div>
    <h2 class="hero-title">Master French <em>the way</em> it’s actually spoken.</h2>
    <p>OnJase teaches real Québec French through authentic conversations, spaced repetition, and the culture behind the words - so you sound like a local, not a phrasebook.</p>
    <%= link_to "Start Learning  →", new_user_registration_path, class: 'btn btn-OJ-primary my-btn' %>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="cards-section">
  <div class="section-head">
    <div class="why">WHY ONJASE</div>
    <h2>Built for how Québec really talks</h2>
    <p>Most apps teach Parisian French from a script. OnJase is built around the rhythm, slang, and warmth of everyday Québécois conversation.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="home-cards">

    <div class="home-card">
      <div>
        <i class="fa-solid fa-brain"></i>
      </div>
      <div>
        <strong>Learn Smarter</strong>
        <p>
          Built on learning psychology, spaced repetition, and real conversational patterns.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="home-card">
      <div>
        <i class="fa-solid fa-earth-americas"></i>
      </div>
      <div>
        <strong>Language & Culture</strong>
        <p>
          Explore local humor, expressions, and daily life for natural fluency.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

      <div class="home-card">
      <div>
        <i class="fa-solid fa-comments"></i>
      </div>
      <div>
        <strong>Real Conversations</strong>
        <p>
          Practice with authentic French text exchanges, not scripted drills.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

      <div class="home-card">
      <div>
        <i class="fa-solid fa-rocket"></i>
      </div>
      <div>
        <strong>Build Confidence</strong>
        <p>
          Get instant AI help with translations, tone, and phrasing.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
